<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Ergo Sept qtr available profit climbs.</title>
<headline>Ergo Sept qtr available profit climbs.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-September versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Available profit		 18.4   vs 14.9</p>
<p>    Capital spending		 11.1   vs  3.9</p>
<p>    Material treated	   12,385,000 vs 12,259,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)		  3,049 vs 2,957</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)		     0.25 vs 0.24</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)		   42,180 vs 42,553</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		55,396 vs 53,013</p>
<p>Full name: East Rand Gold and Uranium Co Ltd, managed by Anglo American Corp of South Africa Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
